firebase.json

# Infrastructure as Code & Terraform Secrets
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Local Configuration Overrides & Developer Overrides
*.local
